{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20116",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.29,
      "end_seconds": 7.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Erm, um, doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.16,
      "end_seconds": 12.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.58,
      "end_seconds": 18.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.33,
      "end_seconds": 26.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Yeah, it's wheezing. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.67,
      "end_seconds": 31.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.99,
      "end_seconds": 40.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "Five days, I think... sorry, ten days, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.49,
      "end_seconds": 45.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Okay, how often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.8,
      "end_seconds": 49.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "It happens every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.14,
      "end_seconds": 58.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "Well, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 58.63,
      "end_seconds": 64.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.39,
      "end_seconds": 80.23,
      "duration_seconds": 14.84,
      "text": "I was getting to that! Sorry, what was I saying, I've also had a chesty cough, for one week. And I've been feeling feverish as well, since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.99,
      "end_seconds": 84.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.46,
      "end_seconds": 88.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Right, not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.76,
      "end_seconds": 94.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.17,
      "end_seconds": 107.52,
      "duration_seconds": 12.35,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about ten years. COPD, for about ten years. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. Yes, migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.1,
      "end_seconds": 109.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.5,
      "end_seconds": 121.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "Yes, COPD is known to us, good to have that clear. What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.92,
      "end_seconds": 125.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.48,
      "end_seconds": 136.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.92,
      "end_seconds": 146.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "I take telmisartan, 40 milligrams, maybe, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.22,
      "end_seconds": 151.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.71,
      "end_seconds": 172.23,
      "duration_seconds": 19.52,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, not with me. I'll bring it next time. Tiotropium inhaler. I take it once a day. Well, um, it's propranolol, 40 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 173.32,
      "end_seconds": 183.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the propranolol was 80 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.45,
      "end_seconds": 187.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.92,
      "end_seconds": 202.81,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "Hmm, not with me. I'll bring it next time. Let me think, I had hydrochlorothiazide at one point, but I'm off it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.54,
      "end_seconds": 220.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.88,
      "end_seconds": 225.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Ah, just my septum straightened, in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.56,
      "end_seconds": 230.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Have you had any coughing up blood or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.2,
      "end_seconds": 243.69,
      "duration_seconds": 12.49,
      "text": "No, no coughing up blood, no weight loss. I did have yellow phlegm at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.49,
      "end_seconds": 254.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Any night sweats, leg swelling, sharp chest pain or ankle swelling at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.52,
      "end_seconds": 258.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Mm, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.38,
      "end_seconds": 267.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.53,
      "end_seconds": 271.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.51,
      "end_seconds": 275.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.54,
      "end_seconds": 288.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.64,
      "end_seconds": 314.22,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 86 beats a minute, saturation 90 percent, blood pressure 133 over 84. And respiratory rate 23, temp 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.76,
      "end_seconds": 319.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.32,
      "end_seconds": 322.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.85,
      "end_seconds": 335.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "There are scattered wheezes on both sides and no crackles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.4,
      "end_seconds": 371.48,
      "duration_seconds": 33.08,
      "text": "You can relax now. From what you've told me and what I found, it points towards an infective exacerbation of chronic lung disease. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. We shouldn't forget a pneumonia. Another possibility is a flare of asthma. Just to be sure I understood. You've had wheezing for ten days, and no ankle swelling or sharp chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.06,
      "end_seconds": 374.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Mm, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.37,
      "end_seconds": 384.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a chest X-ray because of productive cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 386.12,
      "end_seconds": 388.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "The earliest is Wednesday, 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.83,
      "end_seconds": 392.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Wednesday, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.05,
      "end_seconds": 398.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "I think a sputum sample makes sense here, for purulent sputum."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.3,
      "end_seconds": 404.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.18,
      "end_seconds": 425.86,
      "duration_seconds": 20.68,
      "text": "The treatment will be prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. That should help with flare of lung disease. The treatment will be doxycycline, 100 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. That's for chest infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.55,
      "end_seconds": 430.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Ah, alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.88,
      "end_seconds": 444.52,
      "duration_seconds": 13.64,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 450.47,
      "end_seconds": 451.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.25,
      "end_seconds": 455.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 456.45,
      "end_seconds": 460.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Hmm, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 461.26,
      "end_seconds": 462.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}